# Netlify response headers.

# Preview page "Piwik PRO statt GA4", until it is released
# (docs/design-migration.md): kept out of search results by a header as well.
# The page's HTML already says noindex; the header also covers the data files
# Next.js exports beside it (index.txt, __next.*.txt), which carry the page's
# text and cannot hold a robots meta tag. Remove both rules when the page is
# released.
/de/piwik-pro
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/de/piwik-pro/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
